" alt="Frame from Nina's Sodam reel — the Sodam Cafe storefront and green sign on Hawthorne Boulevard, where her visit video opens" loading="lazy" style="object-position:center 34%" />
              <span class="reel-poster-badge"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><circle cx="17.2" cy="6.8" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg> Reel on Instagram</span>
            </a>
            <div class="rcard-body">
              <h3>“A Neighborhood Treasure”</h3>
              <span class="handle">Nina · South Bay Mom Network · @southbaymomnetwork</span>
              <p>Her visit starts at the storefront on Hawthorne, then two spicy tuna tempura onigirazu and a peach fruit tea smoothie, all made to order.</p>
              <a class="watch" href="https://www.instagram.com/reel/DVCdShYEjGL/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch on Instagram &#8599;</a>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="rcard" data-reveal>
            <a class="reel-poster" href="https://www.instagram.com/reel/DVjZGGHj_r5/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Watch Emily's Sodam reel on Instagram">
              <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Frame from Emily's Sodam reel — her poke nachos and poke bowls on the table under the caption 'Trying the viral poke spot in Torrance'" loading="lazy" style="object-position:center 55%" />
              <span class="reel-poster-badge"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><circle cx="17.2" cy="6.8" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg> Reel on Instagram</span>
            </a>
            <div class="rcard-body">
              <h3>Reacting to the Poke Nachos</h3>
              <span class="handle">Emily · @thatbrunchgal</span>
              <p>Her spread from above — poke nachos in front, bowls behind. “Shocked at the prices,” huge portions, and the nachos steal the show.</p>
              <a class="watch" href="https://www.instagram.com/reel/DVjZGGHj_r5/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch on Instagram &#8599;</a>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="reaction-foot">
        <div class="reaction-dots" role="tablist" aria-label="Choose a reaction video">
          <button type="button" data-dot="0" aria-current="true" aria-label="Show reaction video 1 — LA &amp; OC Eats"></button>
          <button type="button" data-dot="1" aria-current="false" aria-label="Show reaction video 2 — Nina, South Bay Mom Network"></button>
          <button type="button" data-dot="2" aria-current="false" aria-label="Show reaction video 3 — Emily, That Brunch Gal"></button>
        </div>
        <p class="reaction-hint">Swipe sideways to browse · each reel opens on Instagram</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

<!-- SIGNATURE HIGHLIGHTS — horizontal swipe carousel, right above the menu -->
  <section class="block" id="signatures" style="padding-top:40px;padding-bottom:26px" aria-label="Signature highlights">
