  </section>

  <div class="band"><p>All food made fresh in-house, every day</p></div>

  <!-- REGULARS: simple sign-in, favorites + repeat a previous order -->
  <section class="block" id="regulars" style="padding-top:42px;padding-bottom:6px" aria-label="Regulars — sign in, favorites, and repeat a previous order">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head" style="margin-bottom:18px">
        <p class="kicker">For Regulars</p>
        <h2>Your usual, one tap away</h2>
        <p>Sign in with just your name and phone number — no password, nothing new to remember. Your favorites and past orders will be waiting here, so you can repeat an order in one tap. Ordering as a guest works exactly as always; you never need to sign in to place a pickup order.</p>
      </div>
      <div id="regularsBody"></div>
      <p class="device-note">Your sign-in, favorites, and past orders are saved with the cafe, so they follow you to any device — sign in with the same phone number.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- MENU HIGHLIGHTS -->
  <section class="block" id="menu">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head center">
        <h2>Menu Highlights</h2>
        <p>The full menu, built from Sodam's Toast page — every category, item, price and photo Toast lists. Tap any item — or its Add button — to see what’s in it, customize it, and add it to a pickup order. Pay at the cafe when you pick up; no payment is taken here. Where Toast lists no description for a drink, none is shown for it here either.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="menu-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Menu categories">
        <button role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-filter="all" id="tab-all">Everything</button>
        <button role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-filter="bowls">Bowls &amp; Nachos</button>
        <button role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-filter="rice">Onigiri &amp; Onigirazu</button>
        <button role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-filter="drinks">Drinks</button>
        <button role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-filter="favs" id="tabFavs" class="fav-tab" hidden>&#9733; My Favorites</button>
      </div>

      <div class="menu-grid" id="menuGrid" data-reveal-group></div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ITEM DETAIL MODAL -->
  <div class="modal-overlay" id="itemModal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modalName" hidden>
    <div class="modal">
      <div class="modal-topbar">
        <button type="button" class="modal-back" id="modalBack" aria-label="Back to the menu">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 12H5"/><path d="M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
          Back to Menu
        </button>
        <button class="modal-close" id="modalClose" aria-label="Close item details and return to the menu">&times;</button>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-photo-wrap">
      <img class="modal-photo" id="modalImg" alt="" hidden />
      <div class="modal-photo-none" id="modalImgNone" hidden>
        <svg width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 8h11v6a5 5 0 0 1-5 5h-1a5 5 0 0 1-5-5V8z"/><path d="M16 9h2a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5h-2M8 2v2M12 2v2"/></svg><span style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em">Photo coming soon</span>
      </div>
      <span class="modal-badge" id="modalBadge" hidden>OUR BESTSELLER!</span>
      </div>
      <p class="modal-sim-note" id="modalSimNote" hidden></p>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <h3 id="modalName"></h3>
        <p class="modal-cat" id="modalCat"></p>
        <div class="modal-price" id="modalPrice"></div>
        <p class="modal-desc" id="modalDesc"></p>
        <div id="modalCustomize">
          <h4>Customize Your Item</h4>
          <div id="modalGroups"></div>
        </div>
        <div id="modalExtra"></div>
        <h4>Special Instructions</h4>
        <textarea id="modalNotes" placeholder="Anything the cafe should know — allergies, extra sauce, no cucumber…" aria-label="Special instructions"></textarea>
        <div class="qty-row">
          <span class="qty" aria-label="Quantity">
            <button type="button" id="qtyMinus" aria-label="One less">&minus;</button>
            <output id="qtyOut">1</output>
            <button type="button" id="qtyPlus" aria-label="One more">+</button>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="modal-addrow">
          <button type="button" class="add-to-order" id="addToOrder">Add to Order</button>
        </div>
        <p class="modal-note">Pay at pickup — nothing is charged here. You’ll choose your pickup time and leave your name &amp; phone at checkout.</p>
        <button type="button" class="modal-back" id="modalBackBottom" style="margin-top:14px" aria-label="Back to the menu">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 12H5"/><path d="M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
          Back to Menu
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>


  <!-- PICKUP CART / CHECKOUT -->
  <div class="modal-overlay" id="cartModal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="cartTitle" hidden>
    <div class="modal cart-modal">
      <div class="modal-topbar">
        <button type="button" class="modal-back" id="cartBack">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 12H5"/><path d="M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
          Back to Menu
        </button>
        <button class="modal-close" id="cartClose" aria-label="Close your order">&times;</button>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <h3 id="cartTitle">Your pickup order</h3>
        <p class="modal-desc">Pay at pickup — no payment is taken here. The cafe is at 23211 Hawthorne Blvd, Suite 100, Torrance.</p>
        <div class="cart-account-note" id="cartAccountNote"></div>
        <div id="cartLines"></div>
        <p class="menu-empty" id="cartEmpty">Your order is empty — tap <strong>Add to Order</strong> on any menu item to get started.</p>
        <div id="checkoutForm">
          <label class="field-label" for="coName">Name for pickup</label>
          <input type="text" id="coName" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your name" />
          <label class="field-label" for="coPhone">Phone number</label>
          <input type="tel" id="coPhone" autocomplete="tel" inputmode="tel" placeholder="(213) 555-0123" />
          <label class="field-label" for="coPickup">Pickup time</label>
          <select id="coPickup" aria-label="Pickup time — Tuesday to Saturday, 11 AM to 6:30 PM"></select>
          <p class="modal-note">Sodam is open Tuesday–Saturday, 11:00 AM – 6:30 PM. Closed Sunday &amp; Monday.</p>
          <label class="field-label" for="coNotes">Note for the cafe (optional)</label>
          <textarea id="coNotes" placeholder="Anything else the cafe should know?" style="width:100%;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--card);color:var(--ink);font-family:inherit;font-size:16px;padding:12px;min-height:64px"></textarea>
          <div class="tip-block">
            <span class="field-label" id="tipLabel">Add a tip</span>
            <div class="tip-grid" role="group" aria-labelledby="tipLabel">
              <button type="button" class="tip-box" data-tip-pct="5" aria-pressed="false"><span class="tip-pct">5%</span><span class="tip-amt" data-tip-amt>$0.00</span></button>
              <button type="button" class="tip-box" data-tip-pct="10" aria-pressed="false"><span class="tip-pct">10%</span><span class="tip-amt" data-tip-amt>$0.00</span></button>
              <button type="button" class="tip-box" data-tip-pct="15" aria-pressed="false"><span class="tip-pct">15%</span><span class="tip-amt" data-tip-amt>$0.00</span></button>
            </div>
            <input type="text" class="tip-custom" id="coTipCustom" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Enter custom tip amount" aria-label="Enter custom tip amount" />
            <button type="button" class="tip-clear" id="tipClear" hidden>Clear tip</button>
          </div>
          <div class="form-error" id="coError" role="alert" hidden></div>
          <div class="sum-rows">
            <div class="sum-row"><span>Subtotal</span><span id="coSubtotal">$0.00</span></div>
            <div class="sum-row"><span>Tax</span><span id="coTax">$0.00</span></div>
            <div class="sum-row" id="coTipRow" hidden><span>Tip</span><span id="coTipAmt">$0.00</span></div>
            <div class="total-row"><span>Total due at pickup</span><span class="amt" id="coTotal">$0.00</span></div>
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="place-btn" id="placeOrder">Place Pickup Order</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- SIGN-IN FOR REGULARS (name + phone, no password) -->
  <div class="modal-overlay" id="signinModal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="signinTitle" hidden>
    <div class="modal">
      <div class="modal-topbar">
        <button type="button" class="modal-back" id="signinBack">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 12H5"/><path d="M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
          Back
        </button>
        <button class="modal-close" id="signinClose" aria-label="Close sign in">&times;</button>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <h3 id="signinTitle">Welcome back, regular</h3>
        <p class="modal-desc">Sign in with the name and phone number you use for pickup — <strong>no password</strong>. We&rsquo;ll pull up your favorites and past orders so you can repeat an order in one tap.</p>
        <label class="field-label" for="siName">Your name</label>
        <input type="text" id="siName" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your name" />
        <label class="field-label" for="siPhone">Phone number</label>
        <input type="tel" id="siPhone" autocomplete="tel" inputmode="tel" placeholder="(213) 555-0123" />
        <div class="form-error" id="siError" role="alert" hidden></div>
        <button type="button" class="place-btn" id="siSubmit">Sign In — No Password</button>
        <p class="modal-note">Your sign-in is saved with the cafe and follows you across devices. Prefer not to sign in? Guest checkout works exactly as always — just close this and order.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- STAFF SIGN-IN (shared staff password — separate from Regulars sign-in) -->
  <div class="modal-overlay" id="staffSigninModal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="staffSigninTitle" hidden>
    <div class="modal">
      <div class="modal-topbar">
        <button type="button" class="modal-back" id="staffSigninBack">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 12H5"/><path d="M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
          Back
        </button>
        <button class="modal-close" id="staffSigninClose" aria-label="Close staff sign in">&times;</button>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <span class="staff-badge">Staff Only — Not for Customers</span>
        <h3 id="staffSigninTitle">Staff Sign-In</h3>
        <p class="modal-desc">This sign-in is <strong>for Sodam staff only</strong> — it unlocks the Staff Orders Board where pickup orders appear. Enter the one shared password for the whole team.</p>
        <p class="modal-desc" style="margin-top:10px"><strong>Not the Regulars sign-in:</strong> customers sign in with just name &amp; phone and <em>no password</em>. If you&rsquo;re a customer, please close this — you don&rsquo;t need this to order, and you won&rsquo;t see the board.</p>
        <label class="field-label" for="staffPw">Staff password</label>
        <input type="password" id="staffPw" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Enter the staff password" />
        <div class="staff-test-note"><strong>Test password in use — change before going live</strong><br />Ask the owner for the current shared staff password. The owner should change the test password before the site goes live — it is checked on the cafe&rsquo;s server, never printed here.</div>
        <div class="form-error" id="staffPwError" role="alert" hidden></div>
        <button type="button" class="place-btn" id="staffPwSubmit">Unlock Staff Board</button>
        <p class="modal-note">You&rsquo;ll stay signed in on this screen until you tap &ldquo;Staff Sign Out — Lock Board&rdquo; on the board or reload the page. Don&rsquo;t leave the unlocked board open where customers can see it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- VIDEO BAND -->
  <div class="video-band">
    <video class="lazyvid" muted loop playsinline preload="none" poster="data:image/jpeg;base64," aria-label="Video tour of Sodam's food — the full spread, a signature poke bowl close-up, and the cafe interior">
      <source data-src="data:video/mp4;base64,